  Supporting conditions, each measured above and each required for this verdict:

    - tree read for the required version : the pinned clone at HEAD 59b8a4489c878fa3a9aa6b7fbae760f2fc80eb9d (STEP 3, STEP 6)
    - required version (pinned pom)      : 3.9.11
    - detected version (PATH mvn)        : 3.9.11
    - both tokens well-formed            : yes (STEP 8, STEP 12)
    - normalized required                : 003009011
    - normalized detected                : 003009011
    - normalized comparison              : equal -> download branch not taken
    - early-return path (L118-121)       : not taken, and no apache-maven* of any
                                           version exists under build/ (STEP 9)
    - build JDK major version            : 17 (STEP 14)
    - nothing installed, upgraded or substituted by this pre-check

  There is no third outcome. This file records either a no-download verdict or a
